#: ../packages/desktop/aegisub.desktop.in.in:4
#: ../packages/desktop/aegisub.metainfo.xml.in.in:6
msgid "Aegisub"
msgstr "Aegisub"

#: ../packages/desktop/aegisub.desktop.in.in:5
msgid "Subtitle Editor"
msgstr "Undertekst-editor"

#: ../packages/desktop/aegisub.desktop.in.in:6
msgid "Create and edit subtitles for film and videos."
msgstr "Opret og rediger undertekster til film og videoer."

#: ../packages/desktop/aegisub.desktop.in.in:12
msgid "subtitles;subtitle;captions;captioning;video;audio;"
msgstr "undertekster;undertekst;tekstning;video;lyd;"

#: ../packages/desktop/aegisub.metainfo.xml.in.in:7
msgid "Create and modify subtitles"
msgstr "Opret og rediger undertekster"

#: ../packages/desktop/aegisub.metainfo.xml.in.in:9
msgid ""
"Aegisub is a free, cross-platform open source tool for creating and "
"modifying subtitles. Aegisub makes it quick and easy to time subtitles to "
"audio, and features many powerful tools for styling them, including a "
"built-in real-time video preview."
msgstr ""
"Aegisub er et gratis open source-værktøj på tværs af platforme til at "
"oprette og ændre undertekster. Med Aegisub kan du hurtigt og nemt "
"synkronisere undertekster med lyd, og det har mange kraftfulde værktøjer til "
"at style dem, herunder en indbygget videoforhåndsvisning i realtid."

#: ../packages/desktop/aegisub.metainfo.xml.in.in:10
msgid ""
"Aegisub was originally created as a tool to make typesetting, particularly "
"in anime fansubs, a less painful experience. At the time of the start of the "
"project, many other programs that supported the Advanced Substation Alpha "
"format lacked (and in many cases, still lack; development on several "
"competing programs have since been dropped for various reasons completely "
"unrelated to Aegisub) many vital functions, or were too buggy and/or "
"unreliable to be really useful."
msgstr ""
"Aegisub blev oprindeligt skabt som et værktøj til at gøre typesætning, især "
"i anime-fansubs, mindre besværlig. Da projektet startede, manglede mange "
"andre programmer, der understøttede Advanced SubStation Alpha-formatet, en "
"masse vigtige funktioner (og det gør mange stadig; udviklingen af flere "
"konkurrerende programmer er siden stoppet af forskellige grunde, der intet "
"har med Aegisub at gøre), eller de var for fejlbehæftede og/eller "
"upålidelige til at være virkelig brugbare."

#: ../packages/desktop/aegisub.metainfo.xml.in.in:11
msgid ""
"Since then, Aegisub has grown into a fully fledged, highly customizable "
"subtitle editor. It features a lot of convenient tools to help you with "
"timing, typesetting, editing and translating subtitles, as well as a "
"powerful scripting environment called Automation (originally mostly intended "
"for creating karaoke effects, Automation can now be used much else, "
"including creating macros and various other convenient tools)."
msgstr ""
"Siden da er Aegisub vokset til en komplet og meget tilpasselig "
"undertekst-editor. Den har mange praktiske værktøjer, der hjælper med "
"synkronisering, typesætning, redigering og oversættelse af undertekster, "
"samt et kraftfuldt script-miljø kaldet Automation (oprindeligt mest tænkt "
"til at lave karaoke-effekter, men nu brugbart til meget mere, f.eks. makroer "
"og diverse andre nyttige værktøjer)."

#: ../packages/desktop/aegisub.metainfo.xml.in.in:12
msgid "Some highlights of Aegisub:"
msgstr "Nogle af Aegisubs højdepunkter:"

#: ../packages/desktop/aegisub.metainfo.xml.in.in:14
msgid "Simple and intuitive yet powerful interface for editing subtitles"
msgstr ""
"Enkel og intuitiv, men kraftfuld brugerflade til redigering af undertekster"

#: ../packages/desktop/aegisub.metainfo.xml.in.in:15
msgid "Support for many formats and character sets"
msgstr "Understøttelse af mange formater og tegnsæt"

#: ../packages/desktop/aegisub.metainfo.xml.in.in:16
msgid "Powerful video mode"
msgstr "Kraftfuld videotilstand"

#: ../packages/desktop/aegisub.metainfo.xml.in.in:17
msgid "Visual typesetting tools"
msgstr "Visuelle typesætningsværktøjer"

#: ../packages/desktop/aegisub.metainfo.xml.in.in:18
msgid "Intuitive and customizable audio timing mode"
msgstr "Intuitiv og tilpasselig lydsynkroniseringstilstand"

#: ../packages/desktop/aegisub.metainfo.xml.in.in:19
msgid "Fully scriptable through the Automation module"
msgstr "Fuldt scriptbar via Automation-modulet"

#: ../packages/desktop/aegisub.metainfo.xml.in.in:43
msgid "Typesetting"
msgstr "Typesætning"

